"P2654918889" "This empty mayonnaise jar is filled with the broken trophies that earned Toothbreaker Jones his cheerful monicker. You retrieved it from a desk drawer in Jones' Superadine Hideout during...<br><br><color deepskyblue>The Superadine Ring</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3090842028" "Superadine has been on the streets of Kings Row for years now, {HeroName}. But, with all the refugees flooding into Kings Row after the destruction of Galaxy City, <color red>The Skulls</color> have really started to push their product. The number of Superadine related crimes is escalating, and the PPD don't seem to have enough manpower to put a stop to it. Only so much good can be done by writing about this. It is time someone took action.<br><br>Will you help me shine the light on the Skulls' activities here in Kings Row? Maybe together we can put a stop to all of this."
// AcceptString :
"P3242084870" "I'll help put a stop to The Skulls"
// SendOffString :
"P626979567" "Great! This city is sick, {HeroName}, and as with any illness, I turn to my good friend Genevieve Sanders over at Crowne Memorial Hospital for a diagnosis of the cause.<br><br>Genevieve has indicated that the hospital's detox wards are reaching maximum occupancy. Superadine addicts are being brought in off the streets in droves, and from what she said, they're suffering from some pretty extreme states of withdrawl. She said that if I could find a hero to help, then she would have some information for them to act on.<br><br>I guess that means you're our hero."
// TaskTitle :
"P3680771981" "<color deepskyblue>The Superadine Ring</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1169096656" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Product Placement</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1510110600" "Talk to Genevieve Sanders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2384394061" "Genevieve said she has some information about The Skulls and their pushing of Superadine on the people of Kings Row. You can find her at Crowne Memorial Hospital."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1044728832" "{HeroName}, Shauna called to let me know you were on your way. Thanks for agreeing to help out.<br><br>More Superadine addicts are showing up to the hospital every day and they're in bad shape. From what I've gathered The Skulls are forcibly addicting people to the drug.<br><br>{HeroName}, a lot of these people lost <b>everything</b> in Galaxy City. They've turned to theft and less savory acts in order to pay for thier next fix. Eventually they either end up arrested, here... or in the morgue.<br><br>Sorry, I just... it's so frustrating... you came here for information in order to solve this problem, not to listen to me go on about it... According to some of my recovering patients, The Skulls have a drug den in <color yellow>Industrial Avenue</color>. People go there to buy their Superadine. If you can hit The Skulls on the streets hard enough, they just might spill the beans on who's running the show, and exactly where that drug den is located."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1059896529" "Question Skulls in Kings Row"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1583809749" "The Skulls are expanding their influence all over Kings Row. Nobody else can really challenge their expansion, so they think they own the place. They're a lot of talk there, but don't let that fool you, there are also a lot of them."
// VillainDescription :
"P2766093955" "Defeat {Remain} Skulls"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P4113809226" "One Skull remaining"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3326491252" "The name <color red>Toothbreaker Jones</color> keeps popping up, and these Skulls were nice enough to tell you where to find him. Time to pay him a visit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P855721107" "Pay Toothbreaker Jones a visit"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P398868236" "Toothbreaker Jones? I've heard of that guy. He is bad news. {HeroName}, be careful. If Jones is cornered in that Superadine Den, there is no telling what he might be capable of."

