"P860583641" "Toothbreaker Jones"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P111652340" "Toothbreaker Jones is a sadistic nihilist who relishes inflicting pain and suffering on his enemies. Most of the Skulls that work with him are equally callous as any weakness is quickly culled. He earned his nickname by busting the teeth out of his victims and carries them around as trophies. Rumors suggest he has jars full of these trophies.<br><br>Jones is a part of a new Skulls' initiative to forcibly addict citizens of Kings Row to Superadine. He's even willing to take people's teeth if they can't afford it. Some truly desperate people have taken that deal."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1016247744" "I don't give a damn if they don't have enough to pay.<t 3>You sell the 'dyne at the increased price 'til that shipment comes in!<t 3>They'll pay one way or another.<t 0.1>"
