"P3159484297" "Oh, you made the wrong move, cape!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3292379139" "I'm gonna bust your face in!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1973990364" "You want some more, huh?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3246975891" "You got nothin', zero! Nothin'!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2203197751" "No, this ain't how it's supposed to go down..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2922864498" "You'll never take us all down!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2375884007" "After I'm done with you, you'll have to eat through a straw!"

