// Dialog :
"P25566167" "Wow, that's going to make an amazing story. {HeroName} takes down Superadine den and busts the leader, saves innocents from The Skulls.<br><br>Unfortunately Jones is just one of several pushers in the area. Taking him down put a dent in the Skulls' profit margin, but I have a feeling that now that you've pushed the Skulls, they're going to shove back. Watch yourself out there, they'll be gunning for you."
// RandomFameString :
"P4099673364" "Nice job taking down that Superadine den, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3003594762" "You mentioned that Jones was talking to someone on the phone about a <i>shipment</i>? I've heard about The Skulls expecting a big shipment from one of my sources. I'm going to talk to her and see if I can get some more details. In the meantime, Genevieve called, she says she has some information about where some more Superadine dens could be located."
// AcceptString :
"P3900981990" "Talk to your source, I'll handle The Skulls"
// SendOffString :
"P1839833920" "The Skulls are cold blooded killers, {HeroName}. Remember that when you are dealing with them. They are more than just nihilists, they actually believe that they can conquer death by becoming one with it."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1154078981" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Push Comes to Shove</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P611143235" "Talk to Genevieve"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1478795160" "Genevieve has been helping rehabilitate Superadine users. According to her, she just got some information on where another of The Skulls' drug dens is located."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2011261561" "My patients have been coming in from all over Kings Row and their stories of where they got their Superadine is almost never the same. The police are certain that The Skulls are just moving their dealer around, but I think it's a combination of that and a number of different pushers setting up shop. One of my patients was at one of these drug dens today. He gave me the address.<br><br><color orange>Genevieve hands you a slip of paper with the address written down.</color><br><br>I already informed the PPD, but I doubt they'll check it out anytime soon and I'm afraid that the Skulls will have packed up and left by then.<br><br>{HeroName}, if we don't start shutting these places down quickly then there will be more people addicted to Superadine than the hospital can handle. The evening news will have a field day if they see addicts lined up on the sidewalk outside."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3727158201" "Shut Down the Superadine Den"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1837256761" "Genevieve is right. If we can't shut down these drug dens then Kings Row is going to be overrun with Superadine addicts."

