"P2645824112" "Mandible and Maxilla are a pair of Skulls reviled for their divvyed up collection of human facial bones. Mandible keeps his victim's lower jaw while Maxilla takes the upper jaw. What these two do with them is a mystery, but they claim that their trophies give them dark power."
