// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1672162833" "Maxilla and Mandible are a pair of Skulls reviled for their divvyed up collection of human facial bones. Maxilla keeps her victim's upper jaw while Mandible keeps the lower jaw. What these two do with them is a mystery, but they claim that their trophies give them dark power."
