"P3683423131" "{HeroName}, what happened?<br><br>The Skulls knew you were coming? But... how?<br><br>Oh no... You don't think that I... no, someone at the hospital must be feeding The Skulls information... but... why would anyone here want to help them?<br><br>I'll be a lot more careful with who I tell what to about the cops and local heroes."

