// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - VicDoorDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1790685671" "Hey, not too close, ok? You hero types are all good in my book, but I don't need another reason for these Skulls gang bangers to be eyeing me for some sort of initiation kill or badge of honor. I got a wife and kids..."
// Answer Text :
"P71385809" "Stockwell told me you were one of the good cops, was she wrong?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3204058228" "Shauna sent you?<br><br>She's like a little sister to me...<br><br>Alright, yeah, I'm your man. What's the situation?"
// Answer Text :
"P1350089172" "(Fill Vic in on the situation)"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3226831833" "Hmmm, that's bad, but I think I know what The Skulls are planning, {HeroName}.<br><br>Word from the street is that the Skulls have got some sort of indoctrination ceremony that's going down tonight. But we've got neither the clues nor the manpower necessary to go hunting for it.<br><br><color orange>Vic puts a hand to his badge and traces the star. He looks down, apparently unaware that he was doing it and looks up at you, his eyes steeled.</color><br><br>Emily can't wait for us to get better information. My shift is about over. We'll hit the streets and find her together."
// Answer Text :
"P2525387903" "Thanks, Johansson. Let's get moving. (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P1457096270" "Give me a moment to prepare. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3825506208" "Her name is Emily Rodriguez. According to her relatives, she didn't show up to work today.<br><br>I talked to Emily's cousin and he said that he's certain The Skulls kidnapped her. Says the cops won't do anything about a missing persons case for 24-hours unless there is evidence of wrong doing, and they just don't have any evidence.<br><br>I told him that you could help."
// AcceptString :
"P3681660970" "Where do we start looking?"
// SendOffString :
"P1320133856" "There's a beat cop who works the Gish by the name of Vic Johansson. He knows the Gish like the back of his hand. Tell him I sent you and he'll drop everything to help you find Emily.<br><br>The Skulls are ruthless killers, I... I don't know how long Emily has..."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4150449675" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Marked For Death</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2194681463" "Find Emily Rodriguez"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2599747271" "Vic's a good guy, {HeroName}, you can trust him to do the right thing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
