// 2 Actor1 :
"P2028859391" "<em=talk t=5 d=5><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Misery. Finish things here without me."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P576965414" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>The shipment arrived early, I must go."
// 2 Actor2 :
"P3803739875" "<em=talk t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>Yes, Chernobog... but..."
// 2 Actor1 :
"P1645375355" "<color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>What is matter?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3262221929" "<em=explain t=5 d=5><color white><bgcolor black><bordercolor white>As a Lord of Death you alone can choose the first death to begin tonight's ceremony."
