// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2548057884" "You rescued Emily Rodriguez, Juan Jimenez, and a number of Anderson Construction employees from The Skulls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1602512213" "Oh, thank the stars that Emily is alive and well. I heard Juan Jimenez got himself mixed up in this as well. I guess in hindsight that's a good thing. It turns out he got a picture of The Skulls' leader and pocketed his memory card before they trashed his camera.<br><br>Juan sent me a copy of the picture and trust me, this is big news..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P135949388" "That guy that Juan snapped a photo of is one of the Lords of Death. Dude goes by the name of <color red>Chernobog</color>. I looked his name up online and apparently it's the name of some slavic god of darkness, or something. Real cheery dude.<br><br>Anyway, according to Emily and Juan, Chernobog left right before you arrived because the shipment we've been hearing about came in early.<br><br>{HeroName}... Emily told me that the shipment is a <b>truckload</b> of Superadine! If it gets onto the streets, Kings Row will be flooded with the stuff!<br><br>If only we knew where the shipment was being delivered to, we could put a stop to this... Damn, you were <b>this</b> close to stopping that shipment and taking out one of their leaders."
// AcceptString :
"P976432297" "Ten to one says that Anderson Construction is hosting the delivery"
// SendOffString :
"P2001810909" "Anderson Construction? But why would they...?<br><br><color orange>Shauna's eyes light up as she connects the dots.</color><br><br>That's why all those workers were rounded up by The Skulls to be killed in their ceremony! They all worked at the Anderson Construction warehouse here in Kings Row. With them going missing, that warehouse would be empty during the delivery!<br><br>{HeroName}! You're brilliant! We've got to hurry and bust that delivery before it's too late. If that Superadine hits the streets there will be <b>no</b> way to stop it.<br><br>You may want to bring some help. If Chernobog is really there, the place will be <b>crawling</b> with Skulls."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2917531816" "Investigate Anderson Construction"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2204880145" "The Skulls are unloading that Superadine as we speak, you need to get over to Anderson Construction now before it is too late!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3404957287" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Death by the Truckload</color>"

