// Dialog :
"P2211818899" "You stopped the Superadine shipment and arrested Chernobog Petrovic one of The Skulls' founders!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P126636303" "I... I can't believe it. You did it! You stopped the Superadine shipment <b>and</b> arrested one of the Lords of Death!<br><br>{HeroName}, I don't know how I or anyone in Kings Row could ever thank you. I mean... The Skulls are going to be looking for some payback. I don't know if I could ever live knowing that I was being hunted... but I guess that's what makes you a hero, huh?"
// RandomFameString :
"P2552498171" "Hey, that's {HeroName}. I heard {hero.gender=male he|she} busted a major Superadine shipment in Kings Row."

